@startuml training_flow
title Three-Phase PPO Training with Validation Set

actor User
participant "train.py" as CLI
participant "TrainingConfig" as Config
participant "BaseTrainingRunner" as Runner
participant "SampleLoader" as Loader
participant "ValueModel" as VModel

User -> CLI: --sample-path, --model, --validation-split
CLI -> Config: create(sample_path, model, ..., validation_split)
Config --> CLI: config

CLI -> Runner: run(config)

== Load & Split ==
Runner -> Loader: load(sample_path)
Loader --> Runner: perspectives (with game_id)
Runner -> Runner: _split_train_val(perspectives, validation_split)
note right
  按 game_id 分组后随机划分
  固定划分，整趟训练不变
end note

== Phase 1: Value Training ==
loop each value_epoch
    Runner -> Runner: shuffle(train_perspectives)
    Runner -> Runner: process batches with gradient accumulation
    note right: 训练 — 仅使用 train 集

    Runner -> Runner: _compute_val_loss(val_perspectives, value_model)
    note right
      model.eval(), no_grad
      复用 _process_value_perspective
      计算后恢复 model.train()
    end note

    Runner -> Runner: record value_loss + val_value_loss
    Runner -> User: print "[Value] Epoch X/Y | value_loss: ... | val_value_loss: ... | grad_norm: ..."
end

== Phase 2: Advantage Re-computation ==
Runner -> VModel: forward all perspectives (no_grad)
Runner -> Runner: re-compute GAE advantages
note right: 使用完整 perspectives（train+val）

== Phase 3: Policy Training ==
loop each policy_epoch
    Runner -> Runner: shuffle(all perspectives), train policy
    Runner -> User: print "[Policy] Epoch X/Y | policy_loss: ... | entropy: ... | grad_norm: ..."
end

== Save Artifacts ==
Runner -> Runner: save weights (policy.pth, value.pth)
Runner -> Runner: save_split_training_artifacts(phase_records)
note right
  loss.csv 新增 val_value_loss 列
  loss.png 新增验证 loss 曲线
end note

@enduml
